 "type": "Feature Layer",
 "description": "This layer represents the current jurisdictional boundary of the Fillmore-Piru Memorial District in Ventura County. The polygon depicts the district boundary for LAFCo reference, public access, planning review, and local government boundary information. Special district boundaries are maintained for reference to official local agency boundaries and may be used to support review of services, governance, and jurisdictional relationships.",
